Description: Native PTY terminal for jailbroken iPhone (RootHide/Sileo) with
 an embedded, self-contained AI environment: Node.js 18.20.4 (arm64 iOS) +
 npm 10 + claude-auth, claude (Claude Code) installed on-device through npm
 with the community-verified V8/iOS flags, an Intl.Segmenter safety shim and
 the `aienv` manager (doctor/fix-node/install-claude). Never touches APT.
